odex</strong> to (1) scrub secrets, (2) re-anchor the repo as the <strong data-start="117" data-end="133">RootWork LMS</strong>, (3) restructure content, and (4) ship a sequence of <strong data-start="187" data-end="200">clean PRs</strong> with revised <code data-start="214" data-end="219">.md</code> governance docs (including a new <strong data-start="253" data-end="266">CLAUDE.md</strong>). It’s written so Codex can run end-to-end with minimal back-and-forth.</p>
