- Screenshot diff (if UI)
- Rollback notes

--------------------------------------------
STEP 8 — FINAL OUTPUT
--------------------------------------------

At completion provide:

1. PR-by-PR summary
2. Final content of:
   - README.md
   - CLAUDE.md
   - SECURITY.md
   - CONTRIBUTING.md
   - docs/PRODUCT_VISION.md
   - docs/ROADMAP.md
