</li>
<li data-start="7098" data-end="7174" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="7100" data-end="7174" data-is-last-node="">Or produce a <strong data-start="7113" data-end="7149">minimal Tailwind theme extension</strong> aligned to RWFW colors**</p>
</li>
