<p data-start="2698" data-end="2860">If you upload the RWFW logo + 5R icons (even as PNGs), I’ll tell you the <strong data-start="2771" data-end="2795">exact best filenames</strong>, where they should live, and how Codex should embed them across:</p>
<ul data-start="2861" data-end="2984">
<li data-start="2861" data-end="2878">
<p data-start="2863" data-end="2878">Header/side nav</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2879" data-end="2915">
<p data-start="2881" data-end="2915">Dashboards (student/teacher/admin)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2916" data-end="2928">
<p data-start="2918" data-end="2928">5R flow UI</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2929" data-end="2957">
<p data-start="2931" data-end="2957">Docs (README + docs pages)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2958" data-end="2984">
<p data-start="2960" data-end="2984">Favicon / social preview</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2986" data-end="3046">Just drop the assets here (zip is fine) and I’ll lock it in.</p>
